"Image; recording to CSV, WAV, NumPy, and Edge Impulse JSON / CBOR with an "
"optional Edge Impulse label, part splitting for long captures, and Record "
"All; a Channel Polling interval in the protocol preferences (`5b4f31a6b3a "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/5b4f31a6b3a>`__, `d1252a24f14 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/d1252a24f14>`__, `bfd7fd72f94 "
